al run, or set `backend.kind: tinker` to train hosted."},"231":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-13","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#5-the-three-training-paradigms","content":"`evsys-sdk` runs **SFT, RL, and distillation** behind one config shape. Each has\na ready-to-run config in `examples/configs/` and a hands-on walkthrough — raw\ndata → transform → config → run:"},"232":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-14","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#5-the-three-training-paradigms","content":"<Card title=\"🎯 SFT — supervised fine-tuning\" href=\"/docs/examples/sft\" />"},"233":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-15","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#5-the-three-training-paradigms","content":"<Card title=\"🏆 RL — reinforcement learning\" href=\"/docs/examples/rl\" />"},"234":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-16","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#5-the-three-training-paradigms","content":"<Card title=\"🎓 SDFT — self-distillation\" href=\"/docs/examples/sdft\" />"},"235":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-17","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#6-go-further","content":"How the Experiment, data, algorithm, and eval layers fit together."},"236":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-18","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#6-go-further","content":"End-to-end recipes: YAML-driven runs, sweeps, RL, distillation."},"237":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-19","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#6-go-further","content":"Swap `mock` for `local` (TRL+peft) or `tinker` (hosted)."},"238":{"id":"/docs/quickstart-20","page_id":"/docs/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart#6-go-further","content":"Add an algorithm, verifier, or backend without forking."},"239":{"id":"/docs/reference","page_id":"/docs/reference","type":"page","content":"SDK Reference","b