cs/reference-339","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#10-the-registry--writing-extensions","content":"**Same pattern** for every point: `register_verifier`, `register_metric`,\n`register_backend`, `register_inference`, `register_transform`,\n`register_data_store`, `register_log_store`."},"580":{"id":"/docs/reference-340","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#external-packages-via-entry-points","content":"No fork needed — declare in your `pyproject.toml`:"},"581":{"id":"/docs/reference-341","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#external-packages-via-entry-points","content":"Groups: `evsys_sdk.{algorithms,verifiers,metrics,backends,inference,transforms,data_stores,log_stores}`.\n`_entry_points.py` loads every entry point in those groups on import."},"582":{"id":"/docs/reference-342","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#11-cli-reference-evsys","content":"`eval model` flags: `--dataset --aliases [--secondary-aliases] --output-dir --inference-kind {local,tinker,mock} --model-name [--adapter-path --checkpoint-path --max-tokens --temperature --max-attempts --batch-size --fail-on-retries]`."},"583":{"id":"/docs/reference-343","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"`evsys_sdk.eval` — generic, domain-agnostic eval infra for scoring model\noutputs (pass\\@k + alias matching). Every inference call is wrapped in\n`call_with_retry` (exponential backoff); exhausted failures surface via a\n`RetryReport` instead of aborting. Project-specific eval harnesses build on this\ninfra in their own repos."},"584":{"id":"/docs/reference-344","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"Public surface:"},"585":{"id":"/docs/reference-345","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`evaluate_model(...)`** — score an `InferenceClient` (local/tinker/mock checkpoint)."},"586":{"id":"/docs/reference-346","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`AliasMatcher`** — alias matching (predicted vs verified aliases)."},"587":{"id":"/docs/reference-347","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`score_rows(...)` / `ModelEvalConfig`** — generic scorer + eval config."},"588":{"id":"/docs/reference-348","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`EvalArtifacts` / `EvalSummary`** — result objects; `summary.retry_report`\ncarries `total_failures`."},"589":{"id":"/docs/reference-349","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`RetryReport` / `RetryFailure` / `call_with_retry`** — the retry layer."},"590":{"id":"/docs/reference-350","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"**`format_summary_markdown(summary, title=)`** — pretty summary."},"591":{"id":"/docs/reference-351","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#12-eval-harness","content":"Prompt helpers: `qwen_chat_prompt`, `qwen3_chat_template_prompt`,\n`extract_predicted_slug`, `DEFAULT_SYSTEM[_NO_THINK]`, `score_rows`,\n`load_eval_dataset`."},"592":{"id":"/docs/reference-352","page_id":"/docs/reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference#13-dashboard-client","content":"`DashboardClient` (`dashboard_client.py`) pushes runs to the EvolvingSystems backend\n(SDK → Django HTTP → Supabase) **and** always mirrors every write to a local\nfolder. It is wandb-offline-style robust: if the backend is unreachable\n(timeout / connection error / 5xx) it logs a warning and keeps going on the\nlocal mirror; a 4xx raises `DashboardClientError`."},"593":{"id"