e":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/data","content":"`Workspace` / `MaterializedDataset`"},"698":{"id":"/docs/concepts/data-20","page_id":"/docs/concepts/data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/data","content":"no (SDK)"},"699":{"id":"/docs/concepts/data-21","page_id":"/docs/concepts/data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/data","content":"pull / cache / lineage"},"700":{"id":"/docs/concepts/data-22","page_id":"/docs/concepts/data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/data","content":"Data formats hold only data. **The algorithm decides which tokens are\ntargets** — the same `ChatMessagesRow` can be used for SFT or as an RL prompt."},"701":{"id":"/docs/concepts/data-23","page_id":"/docs/concepts/data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/data","content":"Next: Algorithms ·\ndata types reference."},"702":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","type":"page","content":"Experiments","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Concepts","Concepts"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts/experiments"},"703":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-0","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments","content":"The organizing unit — a hypothesis, one or more training runs, and an auto-synthesized conclusion."},"704":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-1","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#vocabulary","content":"Vocabulary"},"705":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-2","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"Config objects"},"706":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-3","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments","content":"The **Experiment** is the scientific container: a **hypothesis**, one or more\n**training runs**, and an auto-synthesized **conclusion**. It's the top of the\nspine — `config.yaml → Experiment → arms → backend → eval → artifacts`."},"707":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-4","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#vocabulary","content":"**Experiment** — the top-level study. `Experiment.from_yaml(...).run()` owns\ndashboard experiment/run creation, sweep expansion, per-arm failure\nisolation, post-train scoring, metric forwarding, and conclusion building."},"708":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-5","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#vocabulary","content":"**Training run (arm)** — one `RunConfig` = one concrete training job (one\ncell of a sweep). `runs` / `matrix` produce many arms."},"709":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-6","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#vocabulary","content":"**Run group** — `n_repeats > 1` replicates an arm across seeds (shared\n`group_id`) so variance is a config field, not a bespoke script."},"710":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-7","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#vocabulary","content":"**Hypothesis → success\\_metric → conclusion** — the hypothesis is the\nquestion; `success_metric` ranks arms into `best_arm`; the `conclusion`\nsummarizes the outcome. All recorded on the dashboard."},"711":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-8","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"Object"},"712":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-9","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"Role"},"713":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-10","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"`ExperimentConfig`"},"714":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-11","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"top level: `name`, `output_dir`, stores, one of `run`/`runs`/`matrix`, `n_repeats`/`base_seed`, `parent_experiment_id`, `metadata`"},"715":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-12","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"`RunConfig`"},"716":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-13","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"one run: `data`, `model`, `algorithm`, `backend`, `eval`, `validation`, `seed`, `tags` — the cell the two surfaces plug into"},"717":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-14","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"`MatrixSpec` / `Sweep`"},"718":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-15","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"cartesian expansion over dotted-path axes → many `RunConfig`s via one `expand_runs()`"},"719":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-16","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"`ExperimentResult` / `ArmResult`"},"720":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-17","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"outputs: per-arm metrics + the experiment-level `best_arm`, `conclusion`, `hypothesis`"},"721":{"id":"/docs/concepts/experiments-18","page_id":"/docs/concepts/experiments","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/concepts/experiments#config-objects","content":"**`Experiment`*&#x2A; (OOP, with dashboard bookkeeping) wraps\n&#x2A;*`run_experiment(cfg)`** (the inner per-arm runner). Use `run_experiment`\ndirectly to train without bookkeeping."},"72