es","content":"Standard text block. Works in either OpenAI or Anthropic shape."},"1536":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-21","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"OpenAI-style image block. Works for any vision model that follows the\nOpenAI multimodal content schema (most do)."},"1537":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-22","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Anthropic-style base64 image block."},"1538":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-23","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"`media_type` is the MIME type, e.g. `\"image/png\"`."},"1539":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-24","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Return a renderable image src URL/data-URL for a content block, or None."},"1540":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-25","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Handles OpenAI `image_url` blocks AND Anthropic `image` blocks (both\nURL and base64 variants). Used by dashboard renderers."},"1541":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-26","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"True iff any message in the row carries at least one image block."},"1542":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-27","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Returns 'chat\\_messages' | 'harbor\\_task' | 'prompt\\_dataset' | 'unknown'."},"1543":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-28","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Checked most-specific first: `harbor_task` and `prompt_dataset` have\ndistinctive key pairs; `chat_messages` is any row carrying `messages`\n(the conversation — supervision is decided by the algorithm, not the row)."},"1544":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-29","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Dispatch on row shape — round-trips the JSONL coming off a runner."},"1545":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-30","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Strictly parse raw dicts into typed rows for the given `fmt`."},"1546":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-31","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"This is the standardized boundary between the transform stage and a\nStepBuilder/algorithm: `raw rows -> transforms -> parse_rows(fmt) -> typed\nrows`. `fmt` is a :class:`TargetFormat` (or its string value). Every row\nmust match `fmt` per :func:`detect_format`; a mismatch raises\n`ValueError` naming the offending row — no silent coercion, mirroring the\nSDK's `extra='forbid'` philosophy. Tokenization/rollout stays downstream,\nowned by the algorithm."},"1547":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-32","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Dataclass → plain dict (JSON-serializable)."},"1548":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types-33","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/data_types","content":"Iterate a mixed-format JSONL and yield typed rows."},"1549":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","type":"page","content":"eval","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","eval"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"Generic eval infra for tool-detection / model-output scoring."},"1551":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"Public surface:"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"from evsys\\_sdk.eval import (\nAliasMatcher, ModelEvalConfig,\nevaluate\\_model, EvalArtifacts, EvalSummary,\nRetryReport, call\\_with\\_retry,\nscore\\_rows, format\\_summary\\_markdown,\n)"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"Every inference call is wrapped in `call_with_retry` (configurable attempts +\nbackoff); exhausted failures surface via `RetryReport` instead of aborting.\nThis module is domain-agnostic — project-specific eval harnesses (e.g. an API\nsearch eval) build on this infra in their own repos."},"1554":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/eval/runner&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;runner&#x22;\" />"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/eval/matcher&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;matcher&#x22;\" />"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/eval/retry&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;retry&#x22;\" />"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/eval/model_eval&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;model_eval&#x22;\" />"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval-8","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/eval","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/eval/report&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;report&#x22;\" />"},"1559"