/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult#functions","content":"`\"pass_rate\"` (bare) — looked up on `eval_metrics` (the\nprimary post-training eval), then `metrics` (training-side)."},"1575":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult-15","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult#functions","content":"`\"bench.pass_rate\"` (dotted) — looked up on\n`arm.eval(\"bench\").metrics[\"pass_rate\"]`. The dotted form wins\nwhen an experiment carries multiple named benchmarks and\n`success_metric` picks one explicitly."},"1576":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult-16","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult#functions","content":"Returns `None` if neither path resolves."},"1577":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","type":"page","content":"EvalResult","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","experiment"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult#functions","content":"Functions"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","content":"One benchmark scored against one arm at one moment."},"1581":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","content":"Multiple `EvalResult` entries can attach to an `ArmResult` when an\nexperiment carries several benchmarks under `metadata.benchmark`\n(e.g. a `val` set + a `test` set). The `step` field disambiguates\nin-loop validation rows (with their training-step value) from a\nsingle post-training row (`step is None`)."},"1582":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult#attributes","content":"`None` → scored once post-training; int → in-loop at that step."},"1583":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","type":"page","content":"Experiment","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","experiment"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Functions"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","content":"Bundle ExperimentConfig + dashboard writes + per-arm orchestration."},"1587":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Expand sweep matrix / single-run / multi-run to a flat list of primaries."},"1588":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Each entry is a \"group\" when `n_repeats > 1`. See\n:meth:`_replicates_for` for the per-primary seeded replicates."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Per-primary seed replicates."},"1590":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"For `n_repeats == 1`: returns `[(primary, None)]` — no group.\nFor `n_repeats > 1`: returns N tuples of\n`(\\<RunConfig with name=primary.name__s\\<seed> and seed=\\<seed>>, primary.name)`.\nSeeds run `[base_seed, base_seed+1, ...]` when `base_seed` is set,\nelse `[primary.seed, primary.seed+1, ...]`."},"1591":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Normalize `metadata.benchmark` to a list of `(Benchmark, spec)`."},"1592":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-8","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Accepts three shapes:"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-9","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"`None` / empty → `[]` (no eval)."},"1594":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-10","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"single `dict` (legacy single-benchmark form) → wrapped into a\none-element list with `name` defaulting to `\"benchmark\"` (or\nthe spec's own `name` if present)."},"1595":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-11","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"`list[dict]` (new multi-benchmark form) → each entry must carry\na `name` and may carry `tags` and `run_every`."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-12","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"`self._benchmark_override` (test seam) bypasses everything and\nreturns a single-entry list."},"1597":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-13","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Push the arm's local metrics.jsonl rows to the store."},"1598":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-14","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Runner-time logging writes locally; this batch-forwards to the\ndashboard so the script doesn't have to call backfill\\_step\\_metrics\nmanually after training."},"1599":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-15","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Reconstruct the run output dir the runner wrote into."},"1600":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-16","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"User-supplied factory wins; otherwise pick a default by backend kind."},"1601":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-17","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Falls back to the registry's `get_default_inference_factory` so we\ndon't have to import backend-specific inference modules here — e.g.\n`tinker` registers its own default at module load."},"1602":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-18","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Score each post-training benchmark and attach an EvalResult per entry."},"1603":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-19","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"`score_api_models=False` skips the closed/API-model (`benchmark.models`)\nevals — used for continual stages after the first, since a closed model's\nweights are fixed across stages so one scoring suffices (only the trained\ncheckpoint, which changes per stage, is re-scored)."},"1604":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-20","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Entries flagged with `run_every` are in-loop and skipped here (their\nscoring happens during training in the algorithm wrapper — task\ncommit 2). Entries without `run_every` get a single post-training\n`EvalResult` appended to `arm.evals`."},"1605":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-21","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"After all benchmarks score, the flat back-compat fields\n(`arm.eval_metrics` / `eval_breakdowns` / `eval_seconds`)\nmirror the **primary** eval — the first `test`-tagged\npost-training row, else the first post-training row, else nothing."},"1606":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-22","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Score one benchmark through harbor's rollout engine and upload the\neval rollouts (kind='eval'). Opt-in via `benchmark.engine: harbor`."},"1607":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-23","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"`api_model` (a litellm string) scores a closed / API model instead of\nthe trained checkpoint — same rollout path, `model_client='litellm'`,\nrecorded as its own per-model eval. `None` → the trained checkpoint."},"1608":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-24","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"The trained sampler checkpoint URI from the arm's artifacts."},"1609":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-25","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Train the base `run` once per dataset in `continual.datasets`, in\norder, chaining each stage's final weights (fresh optimizer) into the\nnext. Each completed stage is scored on every benchmark via\n:meth:`_execute_arm`; a chain stops at the first stage that does not\ncomplete."},"1610":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-26","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"With `n_repeats > 1` the *whole chain* is replicated once per seed\n(`[base_seed, base_seed+1, ...]` or `[run.seed, ...]`). Stage *i*\nacross all repeats shares one dashboard group, so variance is aggregated\nper stage. Within a chain, weights are chained only between that chain's\nown stages."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-27","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"The full training-state path (weights + optimizer) of an arm's final\ncheckpoint. Continual learning loads *weights only* from this into the\nnext stage. Distinct from :meth:`_final_checkpoint`, which returns the\ninference-only sampler path."},"1612":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment-28","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment#functions","content":"Register a run group for variance studies; returns its id (or None)."},"1613":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","type":"page","content":"ExperimentResult","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","experiment"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult#functions","content":"Functions"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult","content":"What `Experiment.run` returns."},"1617":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","type":"page","content":"experiment","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","experiment"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"experiments/<date>_<slug>/run.py"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","content":"Experiment — the top-level OOP orchestrator."},"1620":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","content":"What it replaces in researcher scripts: the manual\n`create_experiment` → `create_group` → per-arm `create_run` →\n`run_experiment(cfg)` → `create_eval` → `set_conclusion` choreography.\nToday every sweep script hand-rolls that loop. An `Experiment` collapses it\nto one declarative `.run()` call."},"1621":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","content":"Usage:"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"from evsys\\_sdk import Experiment\nimport src   # registers custom verifiers/transforms"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"Experiment.from\\_yaml(\"config.yaml\").run()"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"Per-arm failure isolation: if one sweep arm raises during training, it gets\nmarked `status=failed` on the dashboard and the remaining arms continue.\nThe experiment finishes `completed` if any arm succeeded."},"1625":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"Config carries the project-shaped fields under `metadata`:"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-8","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"metadata:\nhypothesis: \"...\"\ntags: \\[\"sft\", \"qwen3\\_4b\"]\nproject\\_goal\\_id: \"...\"\nsuccess\\_metric: \"pass\\_rate\"   # which metric ranks arms for best\\_score\nbenchmark:                    # post-training eval (optional)\npath: \"data/benchmark/\\<name>\"\nid: \"\\<dashboard benchmark id>\"\nbreakdown\\_keys: \\[\"toolkit\"]"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-9","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"Dependencies are injectable for testing:"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-10","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"`store`: EvsysStore (None → skip dashboard records, run locally)"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-11","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"`train_fn`: `(cfg) -> list[RunResult]` (default: `runner.run_experiment`)"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-12","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"`benchmark`: `Benchmark` (overrides metadata.benchmark.path)"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-13","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"`inference_factory`: `(RunResult, RunConfig) -> InferenceClient`\n(called once per completed arm to build the eval client)"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-14","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;EvalResult&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/EvalResult&#x22;\" />"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-15","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;ArmResult&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ArmResult&#x22;\" />"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-16","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;ExperimentResult&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/ExperimentResult&#x22;\" />"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-17","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;Experiment&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment/Experiment&#x22;\" />"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-18","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"API models a benchmark should also be scored on, from `models` (list)\nor `model` (single string) on the benchmark spec. Empty when neither —\ni.e. checkpoint-only, the existing behavior."},"1637":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment-19","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/experiment#experimentsdate_slugrunpy","content":"Prediction rows for the in-process (non-harbor) eval path, one per task,\nin the same shape `harbor_eval.eval_predictions` produces — so logger\ncallbacks get the model output + reward regardless of engine."},"1638":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","type":"page","content":"inference","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","inference"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"Built-in inference clients."},"1640":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/claude&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;claude&#x22;\" />"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/local&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;local&#x22;\" />"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/gemini&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;gemini&#x22;\" />"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/tinker&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;tinker&#x22;\" />"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/openai&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;openai&#x22;\" />"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/chat_templated&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;chat_templated&#x22;\" />"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/inference","content":"<Card href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/inference/mock&#x22;\" title=\"&#x22;mock&#x22;\" />"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","type":"page","content":"LocalExperimentStore","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","local_store"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore#functions","content":"Functions"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store/LocalExperimentStore","content":"Thread-safe filesystem mirror for experiments and generations."},"1651":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","type":"page","content":"local_store","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","local_store"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","content":"Always-on local mirror of experiment data (wandb-offline style)."},"1653":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","content":"Every DashboardClient write is also persisted under `EVSYS_LOG_DIR`\n(default `./evsys_sdk`). This guarantees no data is lost even\nwhen the backend is unreachable, and is the *only* store used in offline mode."},"1654":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","content":"Layout (flat by id, so each call only needs its own id)::"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/local_store","content":"\\{log\\_dir}/\nexperiments/\\{experiment\\_id}/experiment.json\ngenerations/\\{generation\\_id}/generation.json\n