learning stages over a single base `run`."},"1672":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","content":"Each entry in `datasets` becomes one training stage: the base `run` is\ncopied with its `data` replaced by that entry, trained in order, and each\nstage starts from the previous stage's weights (fresh optimizer). All stages\nrun inside one experiment and are scored on all configured benchmarks."},"1673":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","content":"Example:\nrun:\ndata: \\{...}            # ignored; the per-stage data below is used\nmodel: \\{...}\nalgorithm: \\{kind: sft, ...}\ncontinual:\ndatasets:"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","content":"\\{dataset\\_name: corpus\\_a, transforms: \\[...]}"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","content":"\\{dataset\\_name: corpus\\_b, transforms: \\[...]}"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","content":"\\{dataset\\_name: corpus\\_c, transforms: \\[...]}"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/ContinualConfig#attributes","content":"Optional stage-name template; uses \\{base} and \\{i}. Default '\\{base}\\_stage\\{i}'."},"1678":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/DataConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/config/DataConfig","type":"p