:[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker/TinkerBackendConfig#attributes","content":"Override the Tinker service URL (rare)."},"2034":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","type":"page","content":"tinker","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","backends","tinker"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker"},"2035":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","content":"TinkerBackend — thin wrapper around the tinker SDK."},"2036":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","content":"prepare() lazily creates a ServiceClient and returns it as a handle along with\nthe chosen model name + a tokenizer. The actual training-client creation is\nleft to the algorithm so it can pick LoraConfig / lr / etc."},"2037":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","content":"Most of the heavy lifting (SFT loop, RL loop, checkpointing, eval cadence) is\nin tinker\\_cookbook — algorithms that target this backend should call into the\ncookbook recipes rather than reinventing the loop."},"2038":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;TinkerBackendConfig&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker/TinkerBackendConfig&#x22;\" />"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;TinkerBackend&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/backends/tinker/TinkerBackend&#x22;\" />"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","type":"page","content":"BaseAlgorithm","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","base"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Functions"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","content":"Template-method base for the SDK's training algorithms. See module\ndocstring."},"2044":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","content":"Subclasses set the `name` / `Config` ClassVars (the registry contract)\nand override :meth:`setup` + :meth:`build_batch` (+ optionally\n:meth:`step_metrics`)."},"2045":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"One-time prep before the loop. Must set `self._steps_per_epoch`.\nOverride in the concrete algorithm."},"2046":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Produce the batch for `step_idx` (0-based). Override."},"2047":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Per-step metrics from the forward-backward result. Default no-op."},"2048":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Validate `ctx.extras` before the backend is allocated. Override to\nfail fast on missing / empty inputs (e.g. no train\\_rows). Default\nno-op."},"2049":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-8","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Extra fields merged into the logged hyperparams. Override to add\nalgorithm-specific counts (e.g. `n_train_rows`)."},"2050":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm-9","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm#functions","content":"Resolve the checkpoint cadence from `save_every` /\n`save_at_fractions`. Identical heuristic across all algos: take the\nGCD of the requested fraction-marks, but fall back to `total/10` if\nthat GCD would pathologically save every other step."},"2051":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","type":"page","content":"BaseAlgorithmConfig","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","base"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","content":"Fields common to every training algorithm."},"2054":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","content":"Concrete algorithms subclass this and add their own knobs (SDFT: `topk`;\nRL: `num_samples` / `verifier_name` / …). `extra=\"forbid\"` so a YAML\ntypo fails loudly. A subclass may re-declare a field to change its default\n(e.g. RL drops `learning_rate` to `1e-5`)."},"2055":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig#attributes","content":"Hard step cap. When set, wins over `num_epochs * steps_per_epoch`."},"2056":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig#attributes","content":"If 0, computed from `save_at_fractions` (GCD-of-marks heuristic)."},"2057":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","type":"page","content":"base","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","base"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"BaseAlgorithm — shared base for the SDK's training algorithms."},"2059":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"Every training algorithm (`sft` / `sdft` / `rl`) used to copy-paste the\nsame composer body: allocate the tinker backend,\nresolve the step count + save cadence, log hyperparams, build the in-loop\nevaluators, wire a :class:`~evsys_sdk.training.loop.TrainingLoop`, run it, and\nrecord the checkpoint artifacts. The only thing that genuinely differed was\n*how each step's batch is built*. This base owns all of the shared plumbing;\na concrete algorithm overrides just the per-algorithm pieces."},"2060":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"The base **is itself a StepBuilder** — it implements `build_batch` and\n`step_metrics` and hands `self` to the loop, so there is no separate\nStepBuilder object to construct. A subclass overrides:"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":":meth:`setup` — one-time prep before the loop. Stash per-algorithm state on\n`self` (tokenized datums for SFT; dataset + teacher client + sampler\nprovider for SDFT/RL) and set `self._steps_per_epoch`."},"2062":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":":meth:`build_batch` — produce the :class:`TrainingBatch` for one step. The\nloss spec rides on the returned batch (`loss_fn` is not a separate\noverride). SFT slices its static datums; RL/SDFT roll out on-policy here."},"2063":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":":meth:`step_metrics&#x60; — &#x2A;(optional)* per-step metrics from the\nforward-backward result. Defaults to `\\{\\}`."},"2064":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"Researchers wanting a one-line tweak (focal loss, an extra metric, a custom\nloss) subclass the concrete algorithm and override `build_batch` /\n`step_metrics` — no SDK change needed."},"2065":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;BaseAlgorithmConfig&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithmConfig&#x22;\" />"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base-8","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;BaseAlgorithm&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/base/BaseAlgorithm&#x22;\" />"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm","type":"page","content":"ComboAlgorithm","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","combo"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboAlgorithm#functions","content":"Functions"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/combo/ComboConfig","type":"page","content":"ComboConfig","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","combo"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/al