rifier fn\\_name fallback, so the\nmaterialized harbor task is self-contained."},"2151":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","type":"page","content":"RLConfig","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","rl"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","content":"Config for :class:`RL` — shared knobs from :class:`BaseAlgorithmConfig`\nplus RL/rollout-engine fields."},"2154":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig#attributes","content":"RL needs a lower LR than SFT — IS gradients can be large."},"2155":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig#attributes","content":"Rollouts per task (`group_size`); >= 2 enables the advantage baseline."},"2156":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig#attributes","content":"Fallback verifier-fn name when a HarborTask's InProcessVerifier leaves\n`fn_name` empty (normally the verifier rides per-row on the task)."},"2157":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig#attributes","content":"Override the rollout agent harness (any harbor `BaseAgent` import path).\nDefault: our `BasicLoopAgent`."},"2158":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","type":"page","content":"rl","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","rl"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"RL — on-policy reinforcement learning, rollouts run by harbor's engine."},"2160":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"Rollouts are handed to **harbor's `Job` engine** (retries, bounded\nconcurrency, timeouts, persistence) via\n:func:`evsys_sdk.training.harbor_engine.run_harbor_rollouts`; this algorithm\njust turns `HarborTask` rows into the engine's inputs and assembles the\nreturned trajectories into importance-sampling-loss Datums."},"2161":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"Composer plumbing lives in :class:`~evsys_sdk.algorithms.base.BaseAlgorithm`;\nRL supplies:"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":":meth:`setup` — parse `HarborTask` rows; stash the backend + the\n`.evsys` rollout workspace."},"2163":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":":meth:`build_batch` — save a sampler checkpoint (on-policy), roll out the\nbatch via harbor, group-normalize advantages, emit IS-loss Datums."},"2164":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"The agent harness is pluggable: by default harbor runs our `BasicLoopAgent`\n(`Chat(TinkerLLM)`); set `agent_import_path` to any harbor `BaseAgent`."},"2165":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-6","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;RLConfig&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RLConfig&#x22;\" />"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl-7","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;RL&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/rl/RL&#x22;\" />"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","type":"page","content":"SDFT","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sdft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT#functions","content":"Functions"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT#functions","content":"`train/mean_loss` = mean negative-logprob of the teacher's\npreferred tokens under the student's distribution."},"2171":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT#functions","content":"The loop already merges `batch.metrics` (teacher entropy / truncated\ncount); here we add the loss derived from the forward-backward output.\nPer-position student logprobs are 0 on non-loss positions, negative on\nthe rest; ignore the zeros."},"2172":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT#functions","content":"The user turn the student sees (no demo). The harbor agent's\nTinkerLLM renders it into a chat-templated prompt internally."},"2173":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig","type":"page","content":"SDFTConfig","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sdft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig","content":"Config for :class:`SDFT`. Inherits the shared training/save/eval knobs\nfrom :class:`BaseAlgorithmConfig`; adds SDFT-only fields."},"2176":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","type":"page","content":"sdft","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sdft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":"SDFT — self-distillation fine-tuning on the SDK training loop."},"2178":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":"All the\ncomposer plumbing lives in\n:class:`~evsys_sdk.algorithms.base.BaseAlgorithm`; SDFT supplies the two\nper-algorithm pieces:"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":":meth:`setup` — parse rows → :class:`PromptExample` dataset, build the\nfrozen teacher sampling client, and stash a per-step *student sampler\nprovider* (snapshots the current weights each step so rollouts stay\non-policy — cookbook parity without monkey-patching `sdft.train_step`)."},"2180":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":":meth:`build_batch` — on-policy student rollout → teacher topK score → CE\ndistillation Datums. :meth:`step_metrics` adds `train/mean_loss` from the\nforward-backward output."},"2181":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;SDFTConfig&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFTConfig&#x22;\" />"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft","content":"<Card title=\"&#x22;SDFT&#x22;\" href=\"&#x22;/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sdft/SDFT&#x22;\" />"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","type":"page","content":"SFT","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT#functions","content":"Functions"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT#functions","content":"Slice `batch_size` Datums for `step_idx`, wrapping the dataset\nwhen the slice straddles the end."},"2187":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT#functions","content":"`train_mean_nll` from the per-position logprobs of each Datum,\nweighted by the loss mask."},"2188":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFT#functions","content":"Tinker's cross\\_entropy loss returns `loss_fn_outputs[i][\"logprobs\"]`:\na per-position vector of log-probabilities of the target token (a\n\"perfect\" prediction has logprob 0; otherwise negative). The mean NLL\nis `-sum(logprob * weight) / sum(weight)` over the loss-mask\npositions, averaged across the batch."},"2189":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig","type":"page","content":"SFTConfig","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig#attributes","content":"Attributes"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft/SFTConfig","content":"Config for :class:`SFT`. Inherits the shared training/save/eval knobs\nfrom :class:`BaseAlgorithmConfig`; adds SFT-only fields."},"2192":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","type":"page","content":"sft","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","Api","evsys_sdk","algorithms","sft"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-0","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":"SFT — supervised fine-tuning on the SDK training loop."},"2194":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-1","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":"All the composer\nplumbing (backend, step/save cadence, evaluators, loop wiring, artifacts)\nlives in :class:`~evsys_sdk.algorithms.base.BaseAlgorithm`. SFT only has to\nsay *how a batch is built*:"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-2","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":":meth:`setup` — standardize rows → typed :class:`ChatMessagesRow`, tokenize\nto a static list of :class:`tinker.Datum` with assistant-span loss masks."},"2196":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-3","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":":meth:`build_batch` — slice `batch_size` datums per step (wrapping the\ndataset so `num_steps` can exceed one epoch)."},"2197":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-4","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":":meth:`step_metrics` — `train_mean_nll` from the per-position logprobs."},"2198":{"id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft-5","page_id":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/evsys_sdk/algorithms/sft","content":"Researchers wanting a one-line tweak (focal loss, custom loss, extra metrics)\nsubclass `SFT` and override `build_batch` / `step_metrics` — no SDK\nchange needed."},"2199":{"id":"/docs