na concrete algorithm overrides just the per-algorithm pieces."],[1465,"Every write is **also** mirrored to a local folder (`EVSYS_LOG_DIR`,\ndefault `./evsys_sdk`). There is no remote-only mode."],[227,"Everything about a run lives in one declarative `config.yaml&#x60;. The repo ships\nthis ready to run at &#x2A;*`examples/quickstart_experiment/`** — two configs (a\n`mock` wiring test and a real `local` train) plus a tiny `run.py` that loads\neither. &#x2A;*The only difference between the two configs is `backend`, `model`,\nand `algorithm` — the data is identical.**"],[877,"Everything above is the file `examples/sft_walkthrough/config.yaml`. The runner\njust loads it and calls the SDK:"],[1831,"Everything an algorithm needs to execute one training run."],[676,"Everything below this page drills into one layer. If you just want to run\nsomething, jump to the Quickstart."],[846,"Everything here is a real, runnable example in the repo at\n&#x2A;*`examples/sft_walkthrough/`**. You can run it directly (see step 6)."],[618,"Everything importable from `evsys_sdk` (the stable surface;\nanything not re-exported here may move):"],[226,"Everything ships in the base install — see Installation."],[372,"Evolutionary lineage"],[164,"Evolutionary loop (kept in `backend/api/experiments/loop.py` for now)."],[1435,"evsys CLI."],[883,"evsys_sdk"],[112,"evsys-sdk — design notes"],[241,"evsys-sdk — SDK Reference"],[889,"evsys\\_sdk — declarative, modular LLM experiment framework."],[1982,"evsys\\_sdk.training — native training-loop package."],[1453,"EvsysAuthError"],[2598,"EvsysLoggerCallback"],[2603,"EvsysLoggerConfig"],[1943,"EvsysStore"],[1949,"EvsysStore — HTTP client for the project → goals/datasets/benchmarks →\nexperiments → groups → runs → checkpoints/evals/metrics hierarchy."],[1946,"EvsysStoreError"],[2763,"EvsysVerifier"],[1276,"Exact signature & behavior"],[360,"Exactly **one** of run/runs/matrix"],[787,"Exactly like SFT: a benchmark is a **directory** with a `tasks.jsonl` of